Hi. Thank you.  
	I fixed cif generator problem which caused lack of semicolon on
USES comment.  I also changed name of comment to INSTANCES.
	There is now no large numbers in file.  This was caused by a bug
in our CIF generator.  The large number was caused by a floating point
error.  The actual position of the frob in question was accurately represented
in our database but the cifout routine blew it.
	The empty symbol problem is real.  (I assume you are referring to the
symbols named "narrow-empty-column", etc.)  We use certain symbols in our
system for "quads" which allow the system to space over by refering to their
dimensions only.  These symbols have no boxes in them.  I don't really see how
we can suppress their occurrence without some drastic action.  If it is really
hard for you to win with them I can probably do something drastic, but I'd
rather not.  Please 
 
